   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Superlative with",
   "texto": [
    "To say «the / the most» without a name behind it, **am** + adjective + **-(e)sten**: **Der Zug fährt am schnellsten** is used (the train goes faster). With **gut**: **am besten**. The termination may include **e** to facilitate pronunciation: **am größten**, **am teuersten**."
   ]
